ed by our complexity reduction initiative.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/07/haemonetics-hae-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"HAE 2019 Q4","e":"hae","d":"2019-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bill Burke","x":"Free cash flow before restructuring and turnaround costs was $70.7 million in fiscal '19, compared to a $161.8 million in fiscal '18.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/07/haemonetics-hae-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"HAE 2020 Q1","e":"hae","d":"2019-08-06","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Larry Keusch","x":"And then just given the rising trade tensions with China, can you just remind us again of your exposure to tariffs, and if there was, what it was in the quarter, and, again, to the extent that there is a meaningful tariff exposure, how you're planning to mitigate it?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/06/haemonetics-hae-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"HAE 2020 Q1","e":"hae","d":"2019-08-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Chris Simon","x":"And we're confident that they're going to deliver, and that a majority of those savings will pass through in terms of our improved financial health.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/06/haemonetics-hae-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"HAE 2020 Q1","e":"hae","d":"2019-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chris Simon","x":"We will improve plan performance by implementing Lean Six Sigma, and we will optimize our network by automating and rightsizing capacity for the future.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/06/haemonetics-hae-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"HAE 2020 Q1","e":"hae","d":"2019-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bill Burke","x":"Additionally, this program will result in restructuring and related charges of 60 to $70 million and additional investments of 60 to $70 million in capital expenditures.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/06/haemonetics-hae-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"HAE 2020 Q2","e":"hae","d":"2019-11-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chris Simon","x":"We expect to deliver our fiscal '21 aspirations of doubling fiscal '16 adjusted operating income and quadrupling fiscal '16 free cash flow before restructuring and turnaround.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/02/haemonetics-hae-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"HAE 2020 Q2","e":"hae","d":"2019-11-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bill Burke","x":"Free cash flow before restructuring and turnaround cost was $31 million in the first half of fiscal '20 compared with $21 million in the first half of fiscal '19.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/02/haemonetics-hae-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"HAE 2020 Q3","e":"hae","d":"2020-02-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bill Burke","x":"We realized productivity savings from our cost-savings initiatives and had lower research and development costs, mainly as a result of project timing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/05/haemonetics-hae-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"HAE 2020 Q3","e":"hae","d":"2020-02-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bill Burke","x":"Free cash flow before restructuring and turnaround costs was $95 million in the first nine months of fiscal '20, compared with $58 million in the first nine months of fiscal '19, primarily driven by higher income and lower capital expenditures, partially offset by higher working capital in fiscal…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/05/haemonetics-hae-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"HAE 2020 Q4","e":"hae","d":"2020-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chris Simon","x":"We are exploring potential risk and opportunities from reforms and market restructuring to understand how our customers, healthcare and society will change.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/05/haemonetics-hae-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"HAE 2020 Q4","e":"hae","d":"2020-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bill Burke","x":"Free cash flow before restructuring and turnaround costs was $139 million in fiscal '20 compared with $71 million in fiscal '19, well within our guidance range of $125 million to $150 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/05/haemonetics-hae-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"HAE 2021 Q3","e":"hae","d":"2021-02-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bill Burke","x":"Free cash flow before restructuring and turnaround costs was $99 million in the first nine months of fiscal '21, compared with $95 [$95.2 ] million in the prior year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/02/haemonetics-corp-hae-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"HAE 2021 Q3","e":"hae","d":"2021-02-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Larry Solow","x":"Bill, just on the operational excellence, nothing new on that in terms of that -- the $80 million, $90 million safe cost savings, productivity gains, and the majority [Indecipherable] bottom line, I think you said by fiscal '23.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/02/haemonetics-corp-hae-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"HAE 2021 Q4","e":"hae","d":"2021-05-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William P. Burke","x":"Free cash flow before restructuring and turnaround costs was $99 million in fiscal '21 compared with $139 million in the prior year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/13/haemonetics-corp-hae-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"HAE 2021 Q4","e":"hae","d":"2021-05-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William P. Burke","x":"We also expect our free cash flow before restructuring and turnaround expenses in fiscal '22 to be $135 million to $155 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/13/haemonetics-corp-hae-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"HAE 2022 Q1","e":"hae","d":"2021-08-11","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"William P. Burke","x":"We expect the majority of the savings realized to benefit adjusted operating income by the end of fiscal '23 and about half of the total savings passing through by the completion of this program in fiscal '25.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/11/haemonetics-corp-hae-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"HAE 2022 Q1","e":"hae","d":"2021-08-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Christopher Simon","x":"We had double-digit growth in our plasma software revenue in the quarter supported by additional recovery in plasma collection volumes and our Donor 360 app, which enables plasma donors to register at home and streamline the pre-collection process with enhanced safety, efficiency, and convenience.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/11/haemonetics-corp-hae-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"HAE 2022 Q1","e":"hae","d":"2021-08-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William P. Burke","x":"Additionally, we expect to incur $95 million to $105 million in restructuring and restructuring related costs over the course of this program.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/11/haemonetics-corp-hae-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"HAE 2022 Q2","e":"hae","d":"2021-11-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"William P. Burke","x":"And then, on the second part of your question regarding the pass through of costs to customers, I think it's just a wait-and-see right now.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/09/haemonetics-corp-hae-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"HAE 2022 Q2","e":"hae","d":"2021-11-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Christopher Simon","x":"As the volume recovers to the point that 20% on the low end of the range that we just talked about, we'll get the benefit of that kind of passing through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/09/haemonetics-corp-hae-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"HAE 2022 Q2","e":"hae","d":"2021-11-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William P. Burke","x":"Additionally, we continue to expect to incur $95 million to $105 million in restructuring and restructuring-related costs over the course of this program.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/09/haemonetics-corp-hae-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"HAE 2022 Q2","e":"hae","d":"2021-11-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William P. Burke","x":"Free cash flow before restructuring and restructuring-related costs was $31 million compared with $38 million in the first half of the prior year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/09/haemonetics-corp-hae-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"HAE 2022 Q2","e":"hae","d":"2021-11-09","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Christopher Simon","x":"We reaffirm our guidance for 15% to 20% organic revenue growth in hospital, including mid-20s Hemostasis Management organic revenue growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/09/haemonetics-corp-hae-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"HAE 2022 Q2","e":"hae","d":"2021-11-09","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"William P. Burke","x":"The lower guidance to free cash flow before restructuring and restructuring-related costs is entirely due to the lowering of our adjusted earnings per diluted share guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/09/haemonetics-corp-hae-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"HAE 2026 Q4","e":"hae","d":"2026-05-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Christopher Simon","x":"Adjusted gross margin in the fourth quarter was 59.7%, down 50 basis points year-over-